UAE e‑invoicing timing.

2
00:00:05,857 --> 00:00:06,239
Myth.

3
00:00:06,239 --> 00:00:13,048
Any business can adopt e-invoicing voluntarily from the first of July twenty twenty-six.

4
00:00:13,048 --> 00:00:23,222
In-scope businesses below fifty million dirhams in revenue must appoint a provider by the thirty-first of March twenty twenty-seven.

5
00:00:23,922 --> 00:00:28,679
Starting early gives you time to test with real invoices.

